Compounding Engineering

The browser payment example adapts the scenario and behavior of the billing
lab in Patterns of compounding engineering, published by grove under the
Apache License, Version 2.0:
https://github.com/grove/patterns-of-compounding-engineering/tree/main/examples

The site introduces and links to three collections published by grove:
Software that improves with age, Engineering that compounds, and
Patterns of compounding engineering. The essays and patterns remain in
their original repositories.
